.DS_Store
**/.git.local/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env*.md
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.nx/cache/
**/.nx/workspace-data/

# Default-deny at repo root (full project trees stay local)
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!nx.json
!.npmrc
!renovate.json
!packages/
!docs/

# Published project roots
!explore-ai/
!explore-iam/
!explore-chat/
!explore-commerce/
!explore-lowcode/

# Ignore one-level entries under project roots, then re-allow docs
*/*
!*/docs/
*/**
!*/docs/
!*/docs/developer/
!*/docs/developer/c4-model/
!*/docs/developer/c4-model/**
!*/docs/Glossary.md
!*/docs/product-owner/
!*/docs/product-owner/**

# Optional project root README under any published project root
!*/README.md

# Nx project registration (keep explore-* internal layouts; track only Nx project.json)
!*/project.json

# Catalogued app source (unified repo; .env / node_modules / dist still ignored above)
!explore-ai/**
!explore-iam/**
!explore-chat/**
!explore-commerce/**
!explore-lowcode/**

# Shared packages (full tree) — after */** so they remain trackable
!packages/
!packages/**

# Platform-level living docs (Explore Nx workspace root)
!docs/
!docs/**
!docs/Glossary.md
!docs/developer/
!docs/developer/c4-model/
!docs/developer/c4-model/**

# After */** so Cursor skills / CI remain trackable
!.cursor/
!.cursor/**
!.github/
!.github/**
